  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……打ち合わせ、思ったより長引いたな\r\n事務所まで……少し急ぐか）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……雨はそろそろやみそうだけど──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00024",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0140",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あれ？　プロデューサーだ！\r\n偶然だねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030070020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、結華。本当、偶然だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今日は外回りか何かだったの？　雨なのに大変だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと打ち合わせがあってな\r\nでもまぁ、俺はそこまで天気が関係する仕事でもないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、さっすが頼もしいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰たちアイドルのために、こんなお天気でも\r\n走り回ってくれるＰたんのこと！　三峰は大好きだよ～",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだなんだ、ずいぶん機嫌がいいんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "おっ。お気づきですね？\r\nさすが三峰のプロデューサー、と言っておきましょう！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "見て見てー、これ！　この傘！\r\nこの間買ったばっかでね、今日がデビュー日なの！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、新しいやつなんだな\r\nオシャレなビニール傘だなぁと思ってたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "飴の柄が可愛い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそう！　三峰もそこが気に入ってね、\r\nもうまさに、お店で一目惚れ！　って感じ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "透明だから、雨が弾けるところも見れて楽しいしさ！\r\nこの傘があれば、雨の日の三峰も最強かも～",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "嬉しそうで何よりだよ\r\n今の結華を見てると、こっちまで楽しくなってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、ちょっと意外だな\r\n濡れるのが嫌だって、雨を嫌がる人もいるのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うーん、そういう人もいるけど……\r\n三峰は濡れるのとか、あんまり気にしないかな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お気に入りの傘を使えることの方が大事でしょ！\r\n可愛い傘さしてると、テンション上がるしさ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、そうかもな\r\n女の子の傘は色んな種類があるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "男の人のって、色にバリエーションが少ないよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "黒とか紺とか茶色とか、シックでお洒落だけど、\r\n三峰はもっとカラフルなのがあってもいいと思うなー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、そうしたら結華みたいに雨の日を楽しめそうだ\r\n……お",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……？　どうしたの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bg": "00003",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010130",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雨、もうやむなと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほんとだー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "white",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "ffffff"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeOutQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "white",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000,
      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect",
    "stillType": "idols",
    "stillId": "1030070020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あれ。結華？\r\n傘、しまわないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだなぁプロデューサーったら！\r\nほーんと、ワビサビ的なものをわかってないよね",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この傘、今日がデビューだって言ったでしょ？\r\n今しまったらもったいないじゃん？",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "まだまだ延長戦、だよ！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほど、そうか\r\n結華の言うワビサビ、俺も勉強しないとなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まずは新しい傘でも買って……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あ、結華っ、後ろ見てみろ！\r\nすごく綺麗だぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え？　なになに？\r\n……わぁ！　虹？　ほんとだ、綺麗……！",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "white1",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
