    "waitType": "effect",
    "stillCtrl": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "虹か……\r\n久しぶりに見たかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "うん、めったに見れないもんね\r\nあはは、今日はいい１日になりそう！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700501/2007005010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007005010200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "こんなラッキーも、この子を持ってたおかげかな？\r\n……だったら感謝しなくちゃだねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
